# Core + OSINT Debian packages, installed in BOTH full and headless modes.
# One package per line. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Desktop/XP-theming packages live in packages.desktop.apt (skipped when
# BLISS_HEADLESS=1). OSINT tools NOT in Debian (theHarvester, recon-ng) come
# from pipx (packages.pipx); amass is a Go tool (packages.go). The provisioner
# skips any package unavailable in your release.

# --- Core utilities ---
git
curl
wget
ca-certificates
unzip
jq
xmlstarlet
imagemagick
python3
python3-pip
python3-venv
pipx

# --- OSINT: genuinely in Debian repos ---
dnsrecon
whois
bind9-dnsutils
libimage-exiftool-perl
